#: prefs.js:57
msgid "OpenAI Codex (optional)"
msgstr "OpenAI Codex（可选）"

#: prefs.js:58
msgid ""
"A sibling section for the ChatGPT logins the codex CLI holds: save them "
"under a name and switch without a browser. Off by default - with it off, "
"nothing under the Codex home is read. Reads auth.json (and the read-only "
"session transcripts) from $CODEX_HOME, else ~/.codex; saved copies are kept "
"mode 0600 next to, never inside, the Claude store. Nothing is uploaded, and "
"no token is ever minted here."
msgstr ""
"这是 codex CLI 所持 ChatGPT 登录的姊妹面板：给它们起名保存，无需浏览器即可切"
"换。默认关闭；关闭时不会读取 Codex 目录下的任何内容。读取 $CODEX_HOME（未设置"
"则 ~/.codex）中的 auth.json 以及只读的会话记录；保存的副本以 0600 权限存放在 "
"Claude 存储的旁边，而不是其中。不会上传任何内容，也永远不会在此签发令牌。"

#
#: prefs.js:61
msgid "Show saved Codex logins"
msgstr "显示已保存的 Codex 登录"

#
#: prefs.js:62
msgid "Adds an OpenAI Codex section below the Claude ones"
msgstr "在 Claude 各节下方添加一个 OpenAI Codex 节"

#: prefs.js:69
msgid "Usage figures are est."
msgstr "数值为估算值"

#: prefs.js:70
msgid ""
"OpenAI publishes no plan-usage endpoint, so the percentages shown are the "
"ones the codex CLI recorded when the API last returned them, stamped with "
"when. Manage the logins with `claudectl codex`."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 未公开套餐用量端点，因此这里显示的百分比是 codex CLI 在 API 上次返回时"
"记录下来的，并带有记录时间。请用 `claudectl codex` 管理登录。"

#: prefs.js:82
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: prefs.js:83
msgid "How often to poll the Claude usage endpoint."
msgstr "轮询 Claude 用量接口的频率。"

#: prefs.js:88
msgid "Refresh interval"
msgstr "刷新间隔"

#: prefs.js:90
msgid ""
"Minutes between updates (min 1). Idle windows back off to 15 minutes, and a "
"poll always lands just after a reset, on wake and when the network returns."
msgstr ""
"更新间隔分钟数（最少 1）。空闲时最长退避到 15 分钟；重置之后、唤醒时以及网络"
"恢复时都会立即拉取一次。"

